  "comment": "The Meerkat (the wormhole vessel, 2026-10-27): where each artifact parameter lives in the game. key = the studio's own key, which IS the field's name on MeerkatWormholeConfig (the page's GAME_NAMES); asset + field = the Unity config field it becomes. Lab-only (never in the game): aiTau (the sim's steering response - the game's AI flies with AIPilot), the stand-in hull's lope*. cruise / pitchYaw / roll / bankShare are the prefab's MeerkatVesselTransformer (bankShare x roll = RollScaler, set by author_meerkat_assets.py), not plain fields. Rounds 13-21 (the tree round the wormhole and the Omnicrystal's roots, MEERKAT.md section 7) map to the same config by the same names; trunkWarp, omniAtOnce, soil*, labyrinthRing*, labyrinthRibs, labyrinthRoughness and forkHintSeconds are not ported yet. Edit this file, never the assets by hand.",
